.Sh RACH2
This is Debian's manual, rendered from the pinned package.
The package's copyright and license terms are installed under
.Pa /usr/share/doc/virgl-server/copyright .
.Pp
The package also installs
.Pa /usr/libexec/virgl_render_server ,
the process in which virglrenderer runs a Venus context's Vulkan calls.
QEMU's virtio-gpu starts it when its device has
.Cm venus=on ;
nobody runs it by hand.
